  "content": {
    "title": "Are banks open on Good Friday in Illinois? Is today a bank holiday? Here's what's closed",
    "text": "Updated April 3, 2026, 6:10 a.m. CTGood Friday is not a federal holiday, so most government services will operate as usual.Most banks, including major ones like Chase and Fifth-Third, will be open on Good Friday.The New York Stock Exchange and Nasdaq will be closed for trading on Good Friday.USPS, UPS, and most FedEx services will be open and delivering mail and packages.Need to deposit a check today? Are banks open on Good Friday?Here's what will be open or closed today in Illinois, from the stock market and USPS mail delivery to banks.Is Good Friday a federal holiday?Good Friday is not specified by law to be one of the 12 federal holidays recognized in 2026, according to opm.gov.Will banks be open on Good Friday, April 3, 2026? Are Chase, Fifth-Third closed?Most banks will be open on Good Friday, April 3, 2026, according to The Federal Reserve.This includes Chase and Fifth-Third.Is the stock market open on Good Friday, April 3, 2026? Is stock market closed today?The stock markets on New York Stock Exchange and the Nasdaq are closed for trading on Good Friday, April 3, 2026. The Securities Industry and Financial Markets Association also recommended an early close at noon EST for the holiday.Is USPS post office open on Good Friday, April 3, 2026? Will mail be delivered today?The United States Postal Service will be open, and mail will be delivered on Good Friday, April 3, 2026.Is FedEx be open today on Good Friday, April 3, 2026?FedEx and FedEx Freight will have modified service on Good Friday, April 3, 2026, but all other delivery options are expected to operate as normal.Is UPS open today on Good Friday, April 3, 2026?UPS Store is open and UPS delivery and pickup services are available on Good Friday, April 3, 2026.Is Good Friday a state holiday in Illinois?No, Good Friday is not one of the state holidays in Illinois. Government offices will be open.Are Illinois schools closed today on Good Friday?Some schools may close on Good Friday, but many will remain open in Illinois. Be sure to check with your local school for details.",
